  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">1 St&#xf6;d till f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttrad politisk milj&#xf6;, kunskap och kapacitet p&#xe5; beslutsfattare, tj&#xe4;nsteleverant&#xf6;rer och medborgare att kunna genomf&#xf6;ras skalas upp reformer som f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttrar fortsatt fattiga m&#xe4;nniskors tillg&#xe5;ng till vatten, sanitet och hygien tj&#xe4;nster. WSP &#xe4;r en globalt, f&#xe4;lt-baserad organisation som f&#xf6;r n&#xe4;rvarande &#xe4;r engagerad i 25 l&#xe4;nder i fyra regioner.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To support enhanced policy environment, knowledge and capacity of policymakers, service providers and citizens to enable implementation of scaled up reforms that improve sustained access by poor people to water, sanitation and hygiene services. WSP is a global, field-based organization that is currently engaged in 25 countries across four regions.</narrative>
  </description>
